    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JERUSALEM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jerusalem is a city in Israel where Meir and Menachem Porush were born and lived."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jerusalem is a city where the family settled and Shlomo Zalman Porush later became a community leader."</data>
