    <node id="&quot;YISHUV HAYASHAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Yishuv haYashan is a historical term referring to the pre-state Jewish community in Palestine where Menachem Porush was a community leader."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yishuv haYashan is a historical term referring to the pre-state Jewish community in Palestine."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yishuv haYashan is the community where Shlomo Zalman Porush was a leader."</data>
